    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The Gardens mellows as mauve stillness sinks behind the sky. I count 12 figures, each engaged in their own way. Nearby, Reef Spiritfree the gardener lingers. The world is lost in grey fog. copper leaves spiral on the wind.</description>
